<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: ate awful cheese -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_awful_cheese.label>comeu queijo horrível</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_awful_cheese.label>
  <!-- EN: I ate some poorly curdled milk with barely any cheese flavour. Disgusting. -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_awful_cheese.description>Comi leite mal coalhado, quase sem sabor de queijo. Que nojo.</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_awful_cheese.description>

  <!-- EN: ate poor cheese -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_poor_cheese.label>comeu queijo ruim</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_poor_cheese.label>
  <!-- EN: That cheese wasn't horrible but wasn't great either. The aftertaste was kind of gross. -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_poor_cheese.description>Esse queijo não era horrível, mas também não era bom. O gosto que ficou na boca era meio nojento.</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_poor_cheese.description>

  <!-- EN: ate normal cheese -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_normal_cheese.label>comeu queijo comum</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_normal_cheese.label>
  <!-- EN: That was some alright cheese. -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_normal_cheese.description>Esse queijo estava razoável.</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_normal_cheese.description>

  <!-- EN: ate good cheese -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_good_cheese.label>comeu queijo bom</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_good_cheese.label>
  <!-- EN: I ate some fine cheese. Delicious. -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_good_cheese.description>Comi um queijo de qualidade. Delicioso.</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_good_cheese.description>

  <!-- EN: ate excellent cheese -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_excellent_cheese.label>comeu queijo excelente</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_excellent_cheese.label>
  <!-- EN: I ate some fine cheese. You can tell when it has had a good amount of time to mature. -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_excellent_cheese.description>Comi um queijo de qualidade. Dá para perceber que maturou pelo tempo certo.</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_excellent_cheese.description>

  <!-- EN: ate masterwork cheese -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_masterwork_cheese.label>comeu queijo obra-prima</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_masterwork_cheese.label>
  <!-- EN: That cheese was simply amazing! It doesn't get much better than this. -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_masterwork_cheese.description>Esse queijo estava simplesmente incrível! Não dá para pedir algo melhor.</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_masterwork_cheese.description>

  <!-- EN: ate legendary cheese -->
  <VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_legendary_cheese.label>comeu queijo lendário</VCE_AteCheese.stages.ate_legendary_cheese.label>
  <!-- EN: I've eaten quite possibly some of the best cheese I've ever tasted! -->
